# Scenario unexpected-refusal (plan 04-20, D-20): outcome harness-fail, exit 14. The cartridge is
# the diagnostic container cut before its 32-byte trailer (built by the suite in its temp
# content dir); the core refuses the load and nothing expects that.
# expect-detail: load-refused role=cart status=IVS_E_MALFORMED reason=1
ivss 1
id unexpected-refusal
profile intv-2609-ntsc-family-p1
content exec boot-stub
content grom zero-grom
content cart diag-cpu-1-truncated.ivsc
run-to 4000 cpu-cycles stop halted
assert halted == yes
